@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "SFR002: Deliver Personalized Recommendations to Users" as SFR002
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Client Predictive Intervention Recommendations" as AIFR009

  client --> CFR001 : View Financial Insights Dashboard\nClient requests data presentation.\nSystem generates consolidated view.
  
  SysAdmin -> SAFR001 : Manage Analysis Parameters\nAdjusts settings for algorithm accuracy and compliance.\nEnsures regulatory adherence (Basel III, etc.)

  FAFR003 <|-- SFR002 : View Predictive Analytics \nFinancial Advisor reviews client-specific forecasts to inform guidance.

  AIFR009 <|-- CFR011 : Send Feedback\nClient provides input for system improvement.\nImproves future recommendations and insights.
  
  SysAdmin -> SAFR007 : Request Investment Opportunity Analysis\nAdjusts parameters based on user risk profile (MiFID II, etc.)
}

@enduml